--    - Enable with 'io.ConfigFlags = bit32.bor(io.ConfigFlags, ImGuiConfigFlags.NavEnableGamepad)'.
--    - Particularly useful to use Dear ImGui on a console system (e.g. PlayStation, Switch, Xbox) without a mouse!
